{"4513750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Void", "steam_appid": 4513750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Survive the Void</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4513750/extras/d43e08e255812939aa4e0163ffe68146.poster.avif?t=1786381305\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4513750/extras/d43e08e255812939aa4e0163ffe68146.webm?t=1786381305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4513750/extras/d43e08e255812939aa4e0163ffe68146.mp4?t=1786381305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by 90s FPS arcade games and survival horror game design, The Void is a relentless FPS that demands both quick reflexes and calculated, tactical restraint and calculated resource management. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>armed with a single gun</strong>. There is no armory to fall back on. Resources spawn at the church once in a while. Doing more with less is the strategy that helps you survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Find Absolution</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4513750/extras/6689de12c15bc9283cc74e0d6c5bbb9a.poster.avif?t=1786381305\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4513750/extras/6689de12c15bc9283cc74e0d6c5bbb9a.webm?t=1786381305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4513750/extras/6689de12c15bc9283cc74e0d6c5bbb9a.mp4?t=1786381305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every pickup is a calculated risk, and Every missed shot brings you closer to death</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive the Void, you must <strong>become an instrument of absolute destruction</strong> against an unrelenting nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momentum is your greatest asset. Outmaneuver, and always stay a step ahead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources are scarce, and spawns are limited. Play carefully.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use precise strikes, and environmental awareness to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face legions of demons in an unforgiving landscape- as the arena shifts from a hunting ground to a claustrophobic trap the longer you survive.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Survive the Void</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4513750/extras/d43e08e255812939aa4e0163ffe68146.poster.avif?t=1786381305\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4513750/extras/d43e08e255812939aa4e0163ffe68146.webm?t=1786381305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4513750/extras/d43e08e255812939aa4e0163ffe68146.mp4?t=1786381305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by 90s FPS arcade games and survival horror game design, The Void is a relentless FPS that demands both quick reflexes and calculated, tactical restraint and calculated resource management. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>armed with a single gun</strong>. There is no armory to fall back on. Resources spawn at the church once in a while. Doing more with less is the strategy that helps you survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Find Absolution</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4513750/extras/6689de12c15bc9283cc74e0d6c5bbb9a.poster.avif?t=1786381305\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4513750/extras/6689de12c15bc9283cc74e0d6c5bbb9a.webm?t=1786381305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4513750/extras/6689de12c15bc9283cc74e0d6c5bbb9a.mp4?t=1786381305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every pickup is a calculated risk, and Every missed shot brings you closer to death</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive the Void, you must <strong>become an instrument of absolute destruction</strong> against an unrelenting nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momentum is your greatest asset. Outmaneuver, and always stay a step ahead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources are scarce, and spawns are limited. Play carefully.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use precise strikes, and environmental awareness to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face legions of demons in an unforgiving landscape- as the arena shifts from a hunting ground to a claustrophobic trap the longer you survive.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "The Void is a wave based survival horror fps inspired by the movie &quot;The Mist&quot; and spiritual theology. You 